        "body": "## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Open GitHub Copilot Chat in VS Code\n2. Set chat language to Ukrainian or Russian (or have Cyrillic text in project context)\n3. Ask Copilot Agent to execute terminal commands in Ukrainian, for example:\n   - \"Підключись до сервера через ssh\"\n   - \"Виконай docker ps\"\n4.  Observe that Agent generates commands with Cyrillic 'с' prefix\n\n## Expected Result\nCommands should be generated with Latin characters only:\n- `ssh root@139.39.139.139`\n- `docker ps -a`\n\n## Actual Result\nCommands are generated with Cyrillic 'с' (U+0441) prefix:\n- `сssh root@139.39.139.139` ❌\n- `сdocker ps -a` ❌\n\nThis causes PowerShell/Bash to fail with:\nThe term 'сssh' is not recognized as the name of a cmdlet, function, script file, or operable program.\n\n\n## Impact\n- Commands fail to execute\n- User must manually remove Cyrillic character\n- Breaks workflow when using non-English languages\n\n## Environment\n- OS: Windows\n- Terminal: PowerShell\n- Chat language: Ukrainian\n\n## Screenshots\n\n<img width=\"401\" height=\"716\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/361bb49a-1008-487d-aa87-2b0f6bd188f8\" />",
